WEBVTT

00:09.342 --> 00:11.970
Tanjiro! Long time no see!

00:12.053 --> 00:14.180
Welcome to my mansion!

00:14.264 --> 00:15.849
It's been a while!

00:15.932 --> 00:17.809
Glad to see you looking well!

00:17.892 --> 00:19.686
You too, Tanjiro.

00:19.769 --> 00:22.397
I'll brew some black tea at 3:00!

00:22.480 --> 00:25.734
I'll make pancakes too!
And smear a lot of butter!

00:25.817 --> 00:30.697
Buttah? Pankehki?
And I barely know black tea.

00:30.780 --> 00:36.077
Sweets! Bread! Pancakes!

00:37.037 --> 00:38.830
Here you go!

00:41.666 --> 00:43.418
Enjoy, Tanjiro.

00:43.501 --> 00:45.837
Is there any right way to eat it?

00:46.671 --> 00:48.256
Like this…

00:49.507 --> 00:51.551
Tanjiro, say "ahh."

00:52.552 --> 00:53.595
Okay.

00:58.224 --> 01:00.393
How is it, Tanjiro?

01:01.227 --> 01:03.772
It's so delicious,
my cheeks are going to fall off.

01:03.855 --> 01:06.066
It's super-duper tasty, right?

01:06.149 --> 01:07.484
Yes, totally!

01:07.567 --> 01:11.112
Tanjiro, after you eat,
could you change into this?

01:12.363 --> 01:15.867
To you who is ignorant of
What eternity means

01:15.950 --> 01:19.162
It's time to show you the answer

01:19.245 --> 01:25.543
Beyond the endless spiral

01:34.177 --> 01:38.973
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA:
HASHIRA TRAINING ARC

01:41.351 --> 01:44.771
The reason why it sounded like an excuse

01:44.854 --> 01:48.316
A weakness that draws in a fleeting future

01:48.399 --> 01:53.530
You mistake it for strength

01:54.906 --> 01:56.741
So detestable, so detestable

01:56.825 --> 01:58.493
So disgraceful, so disgraceful

01:58.576 --> 02:01.871
The heart that is so bleak

02:01.955 --> 02:03.748
So dark, so dark

02:03.832 --> 02:05.708
That it almost hides the moon

02:05.792 --> 02:09.295
If only you weren't here

02:09.379 --> 02:12.882
It sways and sways

02:12.966 --> 02:16.511
Carrying on its intentions
Just like a flower

02:16.594 --> 02:19.889
Taking it all away, taking it all away

02:19.973 --> 02:23.393
It tears the heart just like a storm would

02:23.476 --> 02:26.980
To you who is ignorant of
What eternity means

02:27.063 --> 02:30.525
It's time to show you the answer

02:30.608 --> 02:35.905
Beyond the endless spiral

02:35.989 --> 02:40.118
Who awaits there

02:47.625 --> 02:48.877
Ossu!

02:49.002 --> 02:52.130
All right, everyone, move in sync!

02:52.213 --> 02:53.965
Stretch out your hands!

02:54.382 --> 02:56.092
Jump high!

02:57.135 --> 02:59.429
Now, do a quick spin!

03:03.892 --> 03:06.060
To enhance the sharpness
of your technique,

03:06.144 --> 03:08.521
flexibility training is very important.

03:09.606 --> 03:12.525
Let's stretch, stretch
and stretch some more!

03:14.527 --> 03:16.529
No, no, not like that!

03:17.155 --> 03:19.532
Could you step aside? I'll show you.

03:22.493 --> 03:23.953
Ready?

03:25.538 --> 03:27.415
ARRRRRRGGGH

03:27.498 --> 03:28.708
Keep it up!

03:29.500 --> 03:32.462
It's more brute-force training
than stretching.

03:32.545 --> 03:34.213
-Come here!
-Huh?

03:34.297 --> 03:36.507
Tanjiro, you do it as well.

03:36.591 --> 03:37.842
What?

03:38.509 --> 03:40.011
Are you ready?

03:40.094 --> 03:41.387
Let's start!

03:41.471 --> 03:43.514
Flexibility training…

03:44.140 --> 03:45.516
is hell!

03:52.732 --> 03:57.278
Tanjiro Kamado, I've been waiting for you.

04:00.031 --> 04:04.744
EPISODE 5:
I EVEN ATE A DEMON

04:05.286 --> 04:07.664
-I'm looking forward--
-Shut up or I'll kill you.

04:07.747 --> 04:08.748
Huh?

04:09.374 --> 04:12.252
Kanroji told me about you.

04:13.169 --> 04:17.590
It seems you had quite a fun time
training with her.

04:18.424 --> 04:19.425
Huh?

04:20.885 --> 04:22.971
Enjoyable training, indeed.

04:23.805 --> 04:26.099
You got a letter from Lady Kanroji.

04:29.435 --> 04:31.396
How are you, Iguro?

04:32.146 --> 04:35.900
Today, I had tea with Tanjiro
after training.

04:36.901 --> 04:42.282
Tanjiro's cheeks almost fall off
when he eats or drinks something sweet.

04:42.365 --> 04:43.992
He's so cute.

04:45.827 --> 04:48.413
Kamado!

04:51.040 --> 04:54.669
I won't go easy on you like Kanroji did.

04:55.837 --> 04:58.715
I've just arrived and he totally hates me.

04:59.632 --> 05:01.926
I've prepared your training.

05:10.018 --> 05:15.148
You have to swing your sword
while avoiding these obstacles.

05:16.399 --> 05:18.484
It's to improve your swordsmanship.

05:19.485 --> 05:22.822
I see, and this place…

05:23.823 --> 05:25.325
Is this an execution chamber?

05:26.409 --> 05:30.330
Did these people who are tied up
commit any crimes?

05:31.247 --> 05:32.957
Well, yeah.

05:33.958 --> 05:35.418
The crime of being weak.

05:35.501 --> 05:37.211
The crime of not learning.

05:37.295 --> 05:39.130
The crime of wasting my time.

05:39.213 --> 05:40.882
The crime of irritating me.

05:40.965 --> 05:42.759
They committed those crimes.

05:43.176 --> 05:45.344
Oh, dear, this is gonna be bad.

05:46.137 --> 05:47.305
You'll use this.

05:49.390 --> 05:51.851
I'll show you how to do it once.

06:02.945 --> 06:04.113
That's all.

06:05.364 --> 06:09.577
He can swing his sword accurately
between the members at that speed.

06:10.870 --> 06:12.121
Your turn.

06:15.500 --> 06:17.001
Don't hit me.

06:17.627 --> 06:19.128
Don't hit me.

06:20.171 --> 06:22.423
-Don't hit me.
-Don't hit me.

06:22.507 --> 06:24.550
Please don't hit us!

06:26.594 --> 06:27.845
Do it quickly!

06:27.929 --> 06:29.013
Okay!

06:40.983 --> 06:42.318
Ridiculous.

06:43.319 --> 06:45.238
How can you call that training?

06:48.825 --> 06:50.701
I'll spar with you.

06:51.994 --> 06:53.412
Attack me.

06:54.288 --> 06:55.665
Attack…

06:56.541 --> 06:57.667
Got it!

06:59.836 --> 07:01.462
Don't hit me!

07:05.925 --> 07:07.468
You're hesitating.

07:10.012 --> 07:12.014
This won't accomplish anything.

07:14.809 --> 07:15.935
Here I go.

07:16.936 --> 07:18.438
Even in tight spaces,

07:18.521 --> 07:20.481
I have to strike precisely.

07:22.275 --> 07:23.526
Slow.

07:24.902 --> 07:26.070
This is not good.

07:26.154 --> 07:30.074
When dealing with Iguro, I must not
be concerned about the Corps members.

07:30.158 --> 07:33.035
Get up. Let's start over.

07:35.163 --> 07:37.665
A dreadful training begins.

07:38.416 --> 07:42.420
Even though I'm using a wooden sword,
getting hit will still cause injury.

07:42.503 --> 07:47.133
Iguro's attacks come between
these poor Corps members.

07:47.216 --> 07:49.093
This is really bad!

07:49.177 --> 07:54.015
Because his swordsmanship
bends in unusual ways!

07:56.184 --> 07:57.477
Slow.

07:58.186 --> 08:02.482
He's using the same wooden sword,
so why is it able to bend?

08:03.691 --> 08:06.861
His attacks slither through narrow gaps.

08:07.612 --> 08:08.863
Just like a snake.

08:09.655 --> 08:10.990
Furthermore,

08:11.073 --> 08:16.537
I can hear their inner voices
when I aim at the gaps between them.

08:16.621 --> 08:19.624
Please! Please! Please!
Please don't hit me!

08:19.707 --> 08:22.210
They're pleading with me not to hit them.

08:22.793 --> 08:25.796
This is truly mentally taxing to hear.

08:27.340 --> 08:29.467
Don't hesitate, you piece of trash.

08:30.134 --> 08:34.055
My hands are trembling with tension
I've never felt before.

08:34.138 --> 08:38.100
If I can't swing my sword precisely,
it'll be a disaster.

08:39.936 --> 08:41.604
Oh, no! Sorry!

08:50.404 --> 08:55.076
Kamado, how can you still go on
after all that training with the Hashira?

09:00.456 --> 09:02.250
I don't want to cause trouble

09:03.292 --> 09:05.044
for everyone.

09:09.549 --> 09:11.509
I guess we have to do it as well.

09:12.635 --> 09:13.928
You're right.

09:20.977 --> 09:23.646
I bet this is going to sting the wounds.

09:25.439 --> 09:27.149
It's definitely gonna hurt.

09:28.276 --> 09:29.860
Ready, guys?

09:29.944 --> 09:31.070
Okay, let's soak in.

09:31.153 --> 09:32.280
Yeah.

09:32.363 --> 09:33.948
All together.

09:34.615 --> 09:36.075
One, two, and…

09:40.913 --> 09:42.999
It stings!

09:43.624 --> 09:45.543
DAY TWO

09:48.004 --> 09:49.547
Slow.

09:50.423 --> 09:53.384
There's no point in training
if you're that slow.

09:53.467 --> 09:54.552
Understood!

09:58.139 --> 10:00.516
Why would you slow down your stride?

10:03.894 --> 10:05.688
It stings!

10:06.814 --> 10:09.025
DAY THREE

10:09.567 --> 10:10.610
Slow.

10:11.319 --> 10:12.403
Slow!

10:13.237 --> 10:14.905
Too slow!

10:16.490 --> 10:20.661
Damn it. It stings.

10:22.788 --> 10:25.916
DAY FOUR

10:26.459 --> 10:29.420
What's the matter?
Are you just running, slowpoke?

10:34.300 --> 10:36.886
I have to focus
only on sparring with Iguro.

10:37.845 --> 10:38.846
In real combat,

10:38.929 --> 10:42.391
if your sword gets caught in
a tree or a rock, it could be fatal.

10:42.475 --> 10:47.021
It's the same as swinging the sword
while avoiding obstacles.

10:58.366 --> 11:02.286
Now my I'm able to strike
more precisely than ever before.

11:09.627 --> 11:11.754
Dodge Iguro's attacks…

11:14.215 --> 11:17.093
so I can attack him back!

11:22.932 --> 11:24.141
My attack hit him.

11:27.561 --> 11:30.564
When my attack cut
the hem of Iguro's haori,

11:31.649 --> 11:33.943
he said my training was over.

11:35.903 --> 11:37.196
Thank you very much!

11:38.114 --> 11:39.657
Get the hell out of here.

11:39.740 --> 11:42.535
Just die already, you piece of trash.

11:42.618 --> 11:45.037
Stop being too friendly with Kanroji.

11:46.288 --> 11:50.418
It's sad to be hated until the end.
But why?

11:56.340 --> 11:58.759
Was Shinazugawa's dojo this way?

11:58.843 --> 11:59.969
You're wrong!

12:00.052 --> 12:03.055
Turn right at that corner, you bird-brain!

12:03.139 --> 12:05.433
I see. Turn right there.

12:10.146 --> 12:11.439
Zenitsu?

12:11.522 --> 12:16.026
He… Help me escape, Tanjiro!
Tanjiro, I beg you!

12:16.110 --> 12:17.903
Escape from what?

12:17.987 --> 12:20.448
I can't stand on my feet anymore!
It's impossible!

12:20.531 --> 12:22.950
I've finally managed to escape this far!

12:23.033 --> 12:27.496
I crawled over the walls
and disappeared like a gecko!

12:27.580 --> 12:31.167
My life is in danger!
I'm gonna get killed!

12:38.382 --> 12:43.762
Choose one.
Back to training or get killed by me.

12:43.846 --> 12:47.516
No! Have mercy!

12:47.600 --> 12:49.185
Calm down.

12:49.268 --> 12:52.104
Nah! No! No!

12:52.188 --> 12:53.439
Shut up!

12:54.940 --> 12:55.941
KILL

12:56.025 --> 12:57.109
Carry him

12:57.193 --> 12:58.777
Oh, okay.

13:00.112 --> 13:01.322
Sorry, Zenitsu.

13:01.989 --> 13:03.657
Let's do our best together.

13:05.409 --> 13:06.911
Long time no see.

13:06.994 --> 13:09.288
I'll join your training today.

13:09.371 --> 13:11.081
I'm looking forward to it!

13:13.334 --> 13:14.919
Don't get carried away.

13:16.504 --> 13:19.256
Listen, I don't acknowledge you.

13:20.299 --> 13:21.926
That's totally fine.

13:22.009 --> 13:23.844
I don't acknowledge you either.

13:24.762 --> 13:26.555
You stabbed Nezuko, after all.

13:34.855 --> 13:37.024
He's got nerve.

13:55.084 --> 13:57.086
Shinazugawa's training was so harsh

13:57.169 --> 14:00.756
that I understand why Zenitsu
became like that.

14:00.839 --> 14:06.136
It was a simple striking training
where we could attack Shinazugawa.

14:06.220 --> 14:07.721
We vomited…

14:09.348 --> 14:11.308
and passed out.

14:12.309 --> 14:14.603
It continued without rest, to boot.

14:15.604 --> 14:18.148
Even Iguro gave us breaks.

14:20.484 --> 14:24.989
When Zenitsu woke up, he blamed me
as if I had killed his parents.

14:25.072 --> 14:26.949
You dumbo!

14:27.032 --> 14:29.118
Ouch. Sorry.

14:30.411 --> 14:33.539
Shinazugawa was especially hard on me.

14:33.622 --> 14:35.666
If I let my guard down for even a second,

14:35.749 --> 14:38.836
I'll get seriously injured
and end up back in recovery.

14:41.005 --> 14:43.090
This is too much for the first day.

14:45.092 --> 14:47.052
I'm a mess and covered in vomit.

14:47.928 --> 14:49.972
I'm about to lose confidence.

14:50.055 --> 14:52.182
Wait, big bro!

14:52.266 --> 14:53.642
Genya's voice?

14:56.061 --> 14:57.646
I want to speak with you.

14:59.773 --> 15:00.900
Quit bothering me.

15:01.609 --> 15:03.903
I don't have a brother.

15:07.197 --> 15:10.409
If you don't knock it off, I'll kill you.

15:17.833 --> 15:20.628
It's so different
from the sibling quarrels in my family.

15:20.711 --> 15:23.047
Wanna give up?

15:23.130 --> 15:25.299
Please don't, big bro!

15:26.508 --> 15:29.762
Don't try to be friendly with me!

15:32.890 --> 15:37.770
From what I've seen, you have no talent.

15:37.853 --> 15:40.147
Just quit the Demon Slayer Corps.

15:40.230 --> 15:44.902
Someone who can't use breathing techniques
shouldn't call himself a swordsman.

15:44.985 --> 15:46.403
But I…

15:49.198 --> 15:51.659
Wait, big bro!

15:51.742 --> 15:55.412
I've always wanted to apologize to you.

15:55.496 --> 15:57.998
Do your best, Genya. You can do it.

15:58.999 --> 16:02.461
I don't care, seriously. Get lost.

16:06.423 --> 16:08.342
But I…

16:09.301 --> 16:10.678
I even ate a demon…

16:12.763 --> 16:14.306
to fight until this point.

16:20.187 --> 16:21.355
What?

16:23.107 --> 16:24.483
What did you say?

16:27.152 --> 16:30.656
You said, you ate…

16:37.746 --> 16:39.790
a demon?

16:42.543 --> 16:44.044
-He disappea--
-Genya!

16:52.886 --> 16:55.764
How many more days is this gonna continue?

17:01.353 --> 17:03.105
He's back! He's back!

17:03.188 --> 17:04.982
That heartless man is back!

17:05.065 --> 17:07.484
Get down! Pretend to be passed out!

17:10.529 --> 17:12.698
Huh? Tanjiro?

17:13.240 --> 17:15.868
Huh? He's gonna kill you, Tanjiro!

17:15.951 --> 17:18.579
Why did you destroy the building?

17:19.329 --> 17:20.497
Please stop!

17:25.753 --> 17:29.214
What is this twisted and ominous sound?

17:35.345 --> 17:37.097
That dude is on a rampage, right?

17:37.181 --> 17:40.017
Are we gonna get beaten
outside of training?

17:40.100 --> 17:43.437
What are you doing?
Do you want to kill Genya?

17:44.563 --> 17:46.315
Of course not.

17:47.357 --> 17:51.070
Killing him would be easy,
but it's against the Corps' rules.

17:52.237 --> 17:54.782
I'll make him unable to recover.

17:54.865 --> 18:00.412
However, I'll forgive him
if he quits the Corps right now.

18:00.496 --> 18:02.039
You must be joking!

18:02.122 --> 18:04.666
You don't have the right to do that!

18:04.750 --> 18:06.460
You can't force him to quit!

18:07.169 --> 18:10.047
Didn't you say earlier
that you don't have a brother?

18:10.130 --> 18:12.966
Then don't interfere
with whatever Genya chooses!

18:13.050 --> 18:15.052
Whether he has talent or not,

18:15.135 --> 18:17.930
he decided to risk his life
to fight demons!

18:18.013 --> 18:22.226
If you say you're not his older brother,
I won't let you interfere with Genya!

18:22.309 --> 18:26.021
Without Genya, we wouldn't have defeated
the Upper Ranks Demons!

18:27.106 --> 18:30.067
I won't let you hurt him beyond recovery!

18:32.402 --> 18:33.570
You done?

18:35.239 --> 18:38.534
Then I'll make you beyond recovery first!

18:42.621 --> 18:44.915
Okay, here he comes.

18:49.336 --> 18:50.546
Tanjiro!

18:51.713 --> 18:53.048
This brat…

18:54.007 --> 18:55.342
stopped my punch.

18:59.138 --> 19:01.598
He kicked him!

19:03.642 --> 19:07.104
Zenitsu! Please get Genya out of here!

19:07.187 --> 19:09.148
Hey! You stupid!

19:09.231 --> 19:11.066
Moron! Don't say my name! You fool!

19:11.150 --> 19:13.110
Give a better signal!

19:13.193 --> 19:14.403
Tanjiro!

19:19.408 --> 19:22.911
His kick cut my ear
even though he just grazed it.

19:22.995 --> 19:25.873
You've got some nerve!

19:26.790 --> 19:28.292
Since you want to die,

19:28.375 --> 19:31.253
I'll kill you like you want!

19:31.336 --> 19:34.631
Wait, big bro!
Tanjiro has nothing to do with this!

19:34.715 --> 19:36.175
Let's escape!

19:36.800 --> 19:38.635
Who are you? Let go of me!

19:38.719 --> 19:40.846
It's best to separate people
who are arguing!

19:40.929 --> 19:42.222
Get some distance!

19:42.306 --> 19:47.019
That guy's your older brother?
He's a total freak! I pity you.

19:47.644 --> 19:50.022
Don't insult my brother!

19:50.105 --> 19:52.024
I'm on your side!

19:52.107 --> 19:54.026
Die, brat!

19:56.403 --> 20:00.199
After that, the situation
just became a big mess.

20:01.074 --> 20:03.660
The brawl continued until nearly evening.

20:04.828 --> 20:06.997
Fool! Moron!

20:07.080 --> 20:10.125
I received an official scolding
from the top brass.

20:10.209 --> 20:12.669
My training with the Wind Hashira
was suspended…

20:12.753 --> 20:13.754
NO!!

20:13.837 --> 20:16.632
…and I've been ordered to refrain
from approaching him.

20:19.343 --> 20:21.178
At the end of the day,

20:22.554 --> 20:26.558
I was unable to reconcile
the Shinazugawa brothers.

20:30.187 --> 20:33.273
I didn't mean for this to happen.

20:33.899 --> 20:35.859
The mark isn't clear.

20:35.943 --> 20:38.862
The training isn't bearing fruit.

20:38.946 --> 20:40.781
Actually, it is.

20:40.864 --> 20:43.659
You even went toe-to-toe
with that Wind Dude.

20:43.742 --> 20:44.868
You're amazing.

20:44.952 --> 20:46.119
Is that so?

20:46.203 --> 20:49.081
Why's the Stone Hashira's house
so deep in the mountains?

20:49.164 --> 20:50.290
This is just so stupid!

20:50.374 --> 20:52.209
I think we're almost there.

20:53.460 --> 20:54.920
What's wrong, Zenitsu?

20:55.003 --> 20:56.755
I can hear something.

20:58.048 --> 20:59.174
This way.

21:02.302 --> 21:03.637
This place…

21:03.720 --> 21:04.888
A waterfall!

21:07.724 --> 21:08.850
Someone's there.

21:11.645 --> 21:17.234
Nyo-Ze-Ga-Mon Ichi-Ji-Butsu-Zai
Sha-Ei-Koku Gi-Ju-Gi…

21:20.362 --> 21:23.365
If you clear your heart and mind,

21:24.366 --> 21:26.994
even fire feels cool.

21:31.581 --> 21:35.085
Welcome to my training ground.

21:41.967 --> 21:46.263
The flame that burns heaven

21:46.346 --> 21:53.312
Truer than the truth

21:53.395 --> 21:57.357
The voice of prayers and
The sounds of shouting

21:57.441 --> 22:03.989
Are fleeting like winged insects

22:04.072 --> 22:08.618
Why do those who devour lives

22:08.702 --> 22:15.584
Beg mercy as if not knowing impurity

22:15.667 --> 22:21.757
Those souls that win through
The darkness can only reach

22:21.840 --> 22:26.553
Obtain that eternity

22:26.636 --> 22:32.267
There's a feeling here
That doesn't know demise

22:32.350 --> 22:37.564
Speak your dream, you strong one

22:37.647 --> 22:43.236
A resound congratulating tune of eternity

22:43.320 --> 22:48.992
Into the light that governs the sky

22:49.076 --> 22:53.205
In the corner of the world that is messy

22:53.288 --> 22:57.542
A blade of a sword
That still wriggles and resists

22:57.626 --> 23:03.548
Grovels and struggles miserably

23:05.967 --> 23:07.052
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA:
HASHIRA TRAINING ARC NO. 5

23:07.719 --> 23:10.180
This time I'll tell you about Iguro.

23:10.263 --> 23:12.015
You're still here?

23:12.099 --> 23:14.684
Don't tell me you're here
to bother Kanroji again.

23:14.768 --> 23:17.979
No, that's not it!
It's the Taisho period secret.

23:19.231 --> 23:20.941
Just get on with it.

23:21.066 --> 23:24.027
Here we go, the Taisho period secret.

23:24.111 --> 23:27.906
The name of the snake Iguro carries
is Kaburamaru.

23:27.989 --> 23:31.910
Apparently, his eyes
have different colors from birth.

23:31.993 --> 23:34.496
Finished? Then get lost.

23:34.579 --> 23:36.498
Don't get too close to Kanroji.

23:36.581 --> 23:37.916
Well, but…

23:37.999 --> 23:40.627
Planning to get close to her?

23:41.670 --> 23:44.673
Next up on Episode 6:
"The Strongest in the Demon Slayer Corps"

23:44.756 --> 23:46.007
TO BE CONTINUED
